Elder: The old well is beginning to fill. Look for the number word on the wooden plaque.
Elder: Stand near the well or its stones. Press E to light ONE more stone, or R to turn the last one off.
Elder: Press F near the well when the lit stones match the Kapampangan word.
Elder: The first trials will demonstrate the amount. Then try to remember the words without hints.
Elder: Finish restoring the water and come back to me.
[end_timeline]
